Binaries
--------

The binaries built from this repository (the cabinet build, the console
build and arkade-lcdboot) are distributed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3, as the "any later version" clause permits. The reason
is the Go modules they link: wazero, oto and periph.io are licensed under
the Apache License 2.0, which is compatible with GPLv3 but not with
GPLv2, so a combined binary can only be distributed under GPLv3.
The GPLv3 text is in `LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt`.

The Raspberry Pi build also links hzeller's rpi-rgb-led-matrix, which is
GPL-2.0-or-later and so combines under GPLv3 too.

If you distribute a binary (an SD-card image, a pre-flashed kit, a
cabinet you sell a friend), you must offer the complete corresponding
source under GPLv3 — this repository's and rpi-rgb-led-matrix's — and
ship wazero's NOTICE (`LICENSES/wazero-NOTICE`), as Apache-2.0 §4(d)
requires. `THIRD_PARTY.md` lists every third-party work the repository
vendors, fetches or links, with its licence.
